Subject: Registry for Cantor M2B Platform Preflight Forms

& [RegistryIdentity] is graph-addressable
  + [registry_uuid] is 39bc12cb-04ad-41fa-861d-8aaaa57e3738
  + [profile] is cantor-windows-platform-preflight/0.1
  + [state] is signed_implementation_authority

& [Nodes] are source, research, exploded, canonical, justification, plan, matrix, slice, module, tests, evidence, solution, proof, and completion review

& [Edges] define meaning
  + [source] selects pure_form before physical_preflight
  + [research] supports volume, final_path, identity, remote_protocol, and open boundaries
  + [completed_compile_probe] enables form vocabulary selection without granting calls
  + [canonical] authorizes module and export only
  + [module] supplies later physical probe output contract
  + [physical_probe] remains absent

& [Authority] is exact
  + [canonical_uuid] is dca17a3e-41a6-4e82-80ef-bfde772b991b
  + [signature_uuid] is ad8dc3de-b45a-48c7-aebd-4bc47018ccf2
  + [scope] is pure effect-free forms only

& [RetrievalTerms] include platform preflight, volume information, remote protocol, final path, strong identity, open fault, query fault, complete evidence, NTFS, and disposition

& [NonEdges] are explicit
  + [absent] form validates path existence
  + [absent] form calls Win32
  + [absent] eligible form grants scanner authority
